flowchart TB
  Main[main.jsx: Redux Provider + React mount] --> App[App.jsx: router, auth restore, theme, OAuth token]
  App --> Guard[ProtectedRoute]
  App --> Pages[Pages]
  Pages --> Feature[Feature components: posts/jobs/notifications/layout]
  Pages --> Hooks[useSwipeGesture]
  Pages --> Store[Redux Toolkit store]
  Feature --> Store
  Store --> Slices[auth/chat/connections/feed/jobs/posts/notifications/presence/profile slices]
  Slices --> Services[service modules]
  Services --> Client[apiClient Axios: token, timeout, 401 handling]
  Client --> REST[Express REST]
  Pages --> SocketService[socketService]
  SocketService <-->|Socket.IO events| Server[Express-attached Socket.IO]
  Feature --> UI[UI primitives: Radix + Tailwind]
